  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cyber Security Talent Accelerator</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Cyber Security Talent Accelerator project aims to enhance the impact of the Cyber Security Summer School in 2024 and 2025 by providing a specialised follow-up cyber security training programme for selected participants.This initiative is designed to prepare students for the dynamic cybers ecurity job market in Southern Africa, fostering a mutually beneficial scenario wherein graduates secure quality employment, while local cyber security companies experience growth through an infusion of skilled professionals.</narrative>
  </description>
